replacements.append((
    '"There are nine parts of the Divine Service: Vespers, Compline, Midnight Office,[^4] Matins, four Hours, that is: I, III, VI and IX, and the Liturgy or, instead of it, the Typika"[^5].',
    'There are nine parts of the Divine Service: Vespers, Compline, Midnight Office,[^4] Matins, four Hours (I, III, VI, and IX), and the Liturgy or, instead of it, the Typika[^5].'
))

replacements.append((
    '"Except for the four Hours, of which each has one and the same form, all other parts of the Divine Service have several forms, namely: Vespers -- Great, Daily, and Small; and Great [Vespers], in turn, can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Compline -- Great and Small, and Great [Compline] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Midnight Office -- Daily, Saturday, and Sunday; Matins -- Great and Small, or Daily, and Great [Matins] can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it; Liturgy -- Full: of St. John Chrysostom and of St. Basil the Great, and Incomplete, that is, of the Presanctified Gifts."',
    'Except for the four Hours, of which each has one and the same form, all other parts of the Divine Service have several forms, namely:\r\n* **Vespers**: Great, Daily, and Small (Great Vespers can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it).\r\n* **Compline**: Great and Small (Great Compline can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it).\r\n* **Midnight Office**: Daily, Saturday, and Sunday.\r\n* **Matins**: Great and Small, or Daily (Great Matins can be with an All-Night Vigil or without it).\r\n* **Liturgy**: Full (of St. John Chrysostom and of St. Basil the Great) and Incomplete (of the Presanctified Gifts).'
))

